                "id": "22253611"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Component of an integrin containing attachment complex, which is required for muscle development and maintenance (PubMed:22253611). Probable regulator of cell-extracellular matrix adhesion (PubMed:10893272). Required during initial muscle assembly to form dense bodies and M-lines (PubMed:10893272)"
          }
        ],
        "commentType": "FUNCTION"
      },
      {
        "texts": [
          {
            "evidences": [
              {
                "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
