                "id": "12781130"
              },
              {
                "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305",
                "source": "PubMed",
                "id": "22253611"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Interacts with pat-4/ILK (PubMed:12015115, PubMed:12781130). Probably forms a complex with pat-4 and pat-6 (PubMed:12781130). Component of an integrin containing attachment complex, composed of at least pat-2, pat-3, pat-4, pat-6, unc-52, unc-97 and unc-112 (PubMed:22253611)"
          }
        ],
        "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
