              ],
              "value": "Colocalizes with pat-3/beta-integrin in body wall muscles. Requires unc-52/perlecan and pat-3 to be localized to the muscle cell membrane (PubMed:10893272). Colocalizes with cpna-1 in M line and dense bodies (PubMed:23283987)"
            }
