            ],
            "value": "RNAi-mediated knockdown results in impaired mobility, mitochondrial fragmentation and disrupted integrin attachment complexes in muscle. This leads to degradation of muscle proteins in the cytosol, myofibrillar defects and disruption of sarcomere organization"
